{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f9f2a7cff6b3d3819923de1758f48c418d2f34c37ad856e2c54a15a0c2bbd1c4", "ja": "あははっ、いい感じじゃん！\nこんなのスグに描けちゃうなんて、やっぱすごいよ！", "zh": "哈哈，感觉很不错嘛！\n居然一下子就能画得这么好看，你果然很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "fcca45f14d8a99755469b023429a01c76c31266f77ade51e25bc9ffc8b6368e9", "ja": "ロコって、よくわかんないモノを作ることもあるけど、\n絵はけっこううまいよな！", "zh": "ROCO虽然有时候会做出莫名其妙的东西，\n但画图画得挺好的对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "7a31b0cd8e6be0932f122d36f59217edf0299993444b6f421531a735cf80a4c4", "ja": "モモコはどうですか？", "zh": "桃子你觉得怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "2d2c85267ed666cb5e1f6df80ae57837dda4bb120b74f6bfc3d6d604d4c3af9b", "ja": "……かわいい、と思う。\nこういうユニットなら、やってみたいかも。", "zh": "……桃子觉得很可爱。\n桃子会想成为这种风格的团体的一员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "25e274ee23041e2b5b022a5aeec88a32eb99bb07c584bf5fb6d3794b8298fe0a", "ja": "フィックスですね♪　では、みんなのアイディアで、\nここからブラッシュアップしていきましょう。", "zh": "那就这么Fix了♪接下来就依照大家的Idea，\n逐渐进行Brush up吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "268f3fd1660cf2d933896e6b40743f9e95fa67667aabc2f4478ed318934df565", "ja": "モモコのアイディアも、楽しみにしてますよ♪", "zh": "ROCO也很期待桃子的Idea喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "db060614e039997bf27bcbc51273f741902624f41060a5fd61490de83d85bb03", "ja": "桃子の？　……ロコさんは、桃子のことなんて\nどうでもいいのかと思ってた。", "zh": "桃子的点子吗？\n……本来还以为ROCO姊根本不在意桃子的说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "33743bd3b1aab77f35201bda0aca3d9b7fed645a97561915f9d247b988687b8d", "ja": "ずっとひとりで考え込んでて、\n桃子のほう、全然見なかったし。", "zh": "因为你都一个人在想事情，\n完全没有看桃子这边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "9b825974182367b7a907b46b14c28bc969e87d4aa46dfc445f245577e08037ea", "ja": "モモコは、レトロポップのコンセプトに\nキャッチアップできなくて悩んでました。", "zh": "桃子你是因为无法Catch up怀旧复古风，\n才会感到烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "a0babd107ceed95b11d91546c4b5317fa168055f68d24ea88e176b40ae99a645", "ja": "だからロコは、\nドラフトとしてコンセプトアートを作ってみたんです！", "zh": "所以ROCO才会试着\n画出Concept art来当作Draft啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "ffa89870865e065324d37fa72ce9782339849ee9e914ae034fb8540f82f1d793", "ja": "コンセプトアート？", "zh": "Concept art？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "4d150a3e0a42416442d15e95bff1fe25f0aad3e080103059dbf9aa91fbbba55b", "ja": "ベーシックなアトラクションを表現したアートです♪\nアートにジェネレーションは関係ありません！", "zh": "就是表现出了Basic的Attraction的Art♪\nArt是不分Generation的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
