{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "cd2a6a88a11f6f0f9e1bd8134a501aea3fcb5325bdf100596ca732733cef4036", "ja": "だから、モモコのオピニオン、\nたくさん聞かせてくださいね♪", "zh": "所以请多多告诉ROCO\n桃子你的Opinion喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "619db2138f91c722c623a67f29318b72ce215fcafa3bae1a175ba2e428e70421", "ja": "ロコさん……。", "zh": "ROCO姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "396aedd963e4f5b5dd3ae9da385b7fca2883ff2f538d1d7957e32d13f3b36fc4", "ja": "なーなーロコ！　この衣装、こうしたら\nもっと面白くなりそう！　どう？", "zh": "欸～欸～ROCO！这套服装改成这样\n好像会更有意思！你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "117a6b72ddb3a2e7c6fcdf8ff3cc56d8e6be2bf2fe0c72778388af60f9174f69", "ja": "そうだ、ダンスもレトロっぽい感じがいいよな。\nどういうのがいいかな～。うん、ちょっと考えとく！", "zh": "对了，舞蹈也走怀旧风比较好吧。\n怎么样的舞才好呢……嗯，我再想想看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "02b730c380afdef8363410801053ce7a7f0591c194e5e9b8e2f60d3e536cc418", "ja": "ステージのセットも考えないとだね。\nカラフルなお花のモチーフとか、いいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "舞台布置也得考虑呢。\n就用色彩缤纷的花当主题怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
