{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "21fb978ca10a427dc730608ed36fec11110cb27fe06121f8f427486dcba1668e", "ja": "（コンセプトアートをきっかけに、話が弾みだした。\nどうやら心配なさそうだ）", "zh": "（概念艺术激发了大家的踊跃讨论。\n看来不需要担心了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
