{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "e3b0ec878507ffc40a5b947bc87a97816c36dff8717f583930daa8d380aa54ae", "ja": "さて、いよいよお披露目ライブだ。\nみんな、準備はできてるな？", "zh": "很好，终于到首次亮相演唱会了。\n大家准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "d0f78a622ecfab45f2ce239e93ab22044fc990be86ddde94c76e5cc4412f74b5", "ja": "待ってください！\nロコはもうひとつ、バリアブルなことを忘れてました！", "zh": "等一下！\nROCO又忘了一件Variable的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d829feb78d1c64198b1718e3baa4acfbba812a2743392142fab60133ecddd10e", "ja": "えっ。ま、まだそんなものが？", "zh": "咦？还、还有忘记的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "05f56f6528658916186975c1eccc73cce9bb0e7360e48626e9463d0552ad591f", "ja": "はい。ロコはこのユニットを、\nワールドワイドに展開していきたいって思ってるの。", "zh": "是的。\nROCO想要让这个团体朝着Worldwide发展。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "568084c66827523284bdb0598b2373d969ddb53f88a9f3e379486d545d76a844", "ja": "そのためには、オープニングMCは\nジャパニーズだけではアンサティスファクトリーです。", "zh": "要达成目标，\n开场主持时只讲Japanese是Unsatisfactory的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_06_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "5a5b44c62e0e98916f593dc2321a2602a2545a02c4fcacbdfe7f187d1d4b77fa", "ja": "アユム、イングリッシュのオープニングMC、\nよろしくお願いしますね♪", "zh": "步，就拜托你\n用English开场主持啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
